        <name>setCheckpointStore</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::ingestion::KafkaConnector::setCheckpointStore</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>std::shared_ptr&lt; <ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_checkpoint_store" kindref="compound">CheckpointStore</ref> &gt;</type>
          <declname>store</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Inject a checkpoint store so that ThemisDB checkpoints and Kafka consumer-group offsets are committed in the correct order. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set Checkpoint Store.</para>
<para>When set, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_kafka_connector_1a0cea2c141e9806937d49f403bf165542" kindref="member">ingest()</ref></computeroutput> writes the ThemisDB checkpoint via the store <bold>before</bold> calling <computeroutput>rd_kafka_consumer_close()</computeroutput> (which commits Kafka offsets). This guarantees at-least-once delivery semantics:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>ThemisDB checkpoint written → database knows documents were processed.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Kafka offsets committed → broker will not re-deliver messages.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>If the process crashes between steps 1 and 2, Kafka re-delivers the messages and ThemisDB deduplicates them via the checkpoint. The <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager" kindref="compound">IngestionManager</ref></computeroutput> automatically injects the shared store whenever incremental mode is active.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>store</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Shared checkpoint store; pass nullptr to disable.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">store</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Calls: std::move(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
