<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>auto_offset_reset</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Where to start when no committed offset exists: <computeroutput>"earliest"</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>"latest"</computeroutput>, or <computeroutput>"none"</computeroutput>  </para>
