</para>
<para>The broker list is taken from <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_source_config_1a28200acb1dcd3210a5aee144aaebea8c" kindref="member">SourceConfig::location</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Example usage (JSON format): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">SourceConfig<sp/>cfg{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.source_id<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;events_topic&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.type<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1ingestion_1ac26ea3ec62832c4278b31929df0e755fa4d53341459948070cd1f7e04475d329c" kindref="member">SourceType::KAFKA</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.location<sp/><sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;broker1:9092,broker2:9092&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.options<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>{{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;topic&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;events&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;consumer_group&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis-ingest&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;text_field&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;payload&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;max_messages&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;1000&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_kafka_connector_1a678bd2a1aaf5c9b44606ef238d6395c6" kindref="member">KafkaConnector</ref><sp/>conn;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">conn.initialize(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>stats<sp/>=<sp/>conn.ingest(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;documents&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">nullptr</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Example usage via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_builder" kindref="compound">IngestionBuilder</ref>: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>mgr<sp/>=<sp/>IngestionBuilder(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;mydb&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.withKafkaSource(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;events_topic&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;broker1:9092&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;events&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;consumer_group&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis-ingest&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;max_messages&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;500&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}})</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.build();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>report<sp/>=<sp/>mgr-&gt;ingestAll();</highlight></codeline>
